    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 1998-bonabeau-social-wasp-comb-hexagons.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Polistes dominula / Vespula vulgaris (Social paper wasps) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 94.0/100, audit 2026-10-19-social-wasp-comb-hexagons-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e93f00e/1998-bonabeau-social-wasp-comb-hexagons.py> ;
