<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bonabeau-social-wasp-comb-hexagons-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Karsai & Pénzes (1993) J. Theor. Biol., Theraulaz & Bonabeau (1995) Science & Smith et al. (2021) PNAS stigmergic hexagonal wasp comb architecture, shared-wall pulp economy & 5-7 topological disclination pairs — Model fidelity to source: 95/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements centered hexagonal ring progression and shared-wall economy (`compute_centered_hex_economy`, L126-152), a stochastic Boltzmann stigmergic 2D/3D hexagonal lattice builder (`simulate_stigmergic_wasp_comb`, L173-277), and worker-to-reproductive cell size transitions with paired 5-7 topological disclination dipoles (`simulate_caste_transition_disclinations`, L377-464), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_096_social_wasp_comb_hexagons.lean`." ;
