<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bonabeau-social-wasp-comb-hexagons-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Karsai & Pénzes (1993) J. Theor. Biol., Theraulaz & Bonabeau (1995) Science & Smith et al. (2021) PNAS stigmergic hexagonal wasp comb architecture, shared-wall pulp economy & 5-7 topological disclination pairs — Morphometric validation: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L589-684) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with uncertainty and statistical tests: 8-ring W(R)/N(R) Pearson r = 0.9997 (p = 4.43e-11, RMSE = 0.0212), 7-point beta sweep Pearson r = 0.9919 (p = 1.12e-5, RMSE = 0.0487), WT 6-ring W/N = 3.315 (ref 3.3071), 6-ring pulp savings 44.88% (ref 44.88%), Eden random negative control W/N = 4.252 (ref 4.18), lambda = 1.30 caste step 5-7 defect count 6 pairs (ref 6), net Euler topological charge 0 (ref 0), specimen interior coordination <z_int> = 5.862 ± 0.893 (ref 6.0), and specimen segmented brood cell count 169 (ref 169)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
