<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bonabeau-social-wasp-comb-hexagons-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Karsai & Pénzes (1993) J. Theor. Biol., Theraulaz & Bonabeau (1995) Science & Smith et al. (2021) PNAS stigmergic hexagonal wasp comb architecture, shared-wall pulp economy & 5-7 topological disclination pairs — MorphoEval overall 94.0/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `1998-bonabeau-social-wasp-comb-hexagons.py` (overall weighted score: 93.9/100, up from 56.2/100 in v1). The remediated script simulates stochastic Boltzmann stigmergic cell initiation P_init(j) ~ exp(beta*k_j) on a 2D/3D hexagonal lattice; validates the 8-ring centered hexagonal economy trajectory R in [0, 7] (Pearson r = 0.9997, p = 4.43e-11, RMSE = 0.0212 walls/cell, 44.88% pulp savings at R = 6) and the 7-point stigmergic selectivity sweep beta in [0.0, 5.5] (Pearson r = 0.9919, RMSE = 0.0487 walls/cell), including the beta = 0.0 Eden random branched comb negative control; models the Smith et al. (2021) worker-to-reproductive cell size step (lambda in [1.00, 1.40]) inducing paired 5-7 topological disclination dipoles with zero net Euler charge; and segments the SHA-256-locked CC BY 2.0 Polistes paper wasp comb specimen (`polistes_wasp_comb_specimen.jpg`, n = 169 brood cells, interior coordination <z_int> = 5.862 ± 0.893 vs hexagonal 6.0). Overall 94.0/100 (faithfulness 93.9, reproducibility 94.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit e93f00e; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 95, Morphological realism / specimen match 93, Parameter expressivity 94, Morphometric validation 94, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 93, Reproducibility package 94. Output judged: docs/media/social_wasp_comb_hexagons_comparison.png: rendered output of 1998-bonabeau-social-wasp-comb-hexagons.py at e93f00e, image/png, 1143280 B, 2775×1680 px, artifact_sha256 83089887ecb6d2547717132ad5b16fce3140a45fb74fbd968349f993fb2d9325 (sha256 83089887ecb6d2547717132ad5b16fce3140a45fb74fbd968349f993fb2d9325), spec_fingerprint 6471896f9ec341c70d5d90fdfc768c186b2e5e7ed95f0e8568fe6372d790ffc3. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 6471896f9ec341c70d5d90fdfc768c186b2e5e7ed95f0e8568fe6372d790ffc3; artifact_sha256: 83089887ecb6d2547717132ad5b16fce3140a45fb74fbd968349f993fb2d9325; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/social_wasp_comb_hexagons/paper_citations.bib=9b09023aaea52aa7..., datasets/social_wasp_comb_hexagons/polistes_wasp_comb_specimen.jpg=03befd4d1fbfa35a..., datasets/social_wasp_comb_hexagons/scout_manifest.json=63f51b932c469536..., datasets/social_wasp_comb_hexagons/social_wasp_comb_hexagons_reference.json=5d67bfb268fa3003...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-social-wasp-comb-hexagons-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D/3D stigmergic hexagonal lattice builder to a continuous elasto-capillary pulp meniscus model resolving corner rounding during fresh pulp drying." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

